---
export const prerender = false; // Required for <form action={actions.*}> to work reliably in SSR mode.
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import Form from "../components/Form.astro";
---

<Layout title="Lu & Sebastian">
  <!-- WELCOME BLOCK -->
  <h1 data-lang-text="de">Wir heiraten</h1>
  <h1 data-lang-text="en">We are getting married!</h1>

  <div class="info-block-left" , data-lang-text="de">
    <p>Und freuen uns, wenn ihr Teil dieses besonderen Tages seid!</p>
    <p><b>Am Samstag, den 02. Mai 2026</b></p>
    <p class="tight">
      Die freie Trauung findet um <b>14:30 Uhr</b> am <a
        href="https://maps.app.goo.gl/SqsMLyRHctgvPfgX7">Mainufer in Segnitz</a
      > statt
    </p>
    <p class="tight">
      Anschließen feiern wir im <a
        href="https://maps.app.goo.gl/gF4MLrDUPP3zEWkF9"
        >Lagerhalle, Marktbreit</a
      >.
    </p>
  </div>
  <div class="info-block-left" , data-lang-text="en">
    <p>And we would love for you to be part of this special day</p>
    <p><b>On Saturday, Maz 2nd, 2026</b></p>
    <p class="tight">
      Join us for our wedding ceremony at <b>2:30 pm</b> by the <a
        href="https://maps.app.goo.gl/SqsMLyRHctgvPfgX7"
        >riverside of the Main in Segnitz</a
      >
    </p>
    <p class="tight">
      Afterwards, we'll all celebrate together at the <a
        href="https://maps.app.goo.gl/gF4MLrDUPP3zEWkF9"
        >Lagerhalle in Marktbreit</a
      >.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="line"></div>
  <!-- TRAUZEUGEN -->
  <div class="info-block-right" , data-lang-text="de">
    <p class="header"><b>Die Trauzeugen</b></p>
    <p class="tight">
      Für alle Fragen rund um Unterkunft oder Programm wendet euch bitte an:
    </p>
    <table class="clean-table">
      <tr>
        <td>Oliver Ziegler</td>
        <td>+49 160 1587297</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td>Anna Ulrich</td>
        <td>+49 172 2184865</td>
      </tr>
    </table>
  </div>

  <div class="info-block-right" , data-lang-text="en">
    <p class="header"><b>Our Witnesses</b></p>
    <p class="tight">
      For any questions about accommodation or program please contact :
    </p>
    <table class="clean-table">
      <tr>
        <td>Oliver Ziegler</td>
        <td>+49 160 1587297</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td>Anna Ulrich</td>
        <td>+49 172 2184865</td>
      </tr>
    </table>
  </div>

  <div class="line"></div>
  <!-- PROGRAMM BLOCK  -->
  <div class="info-block-left" , data-lang-text="de">
    <p class="header"><b>Dabei sein</b></p>
    <p class="tight">
      Euer Dabeisein ist das wichtigste! Falls ihr uns trotzdem eine Freude
      machen möchtet, freuen wir uns über einen Zuschuss zu unserer Reisekasse.
    </p>
    <p class="tight">
      Ihr möchtet Teil des Abendprogramms werden? Sprecht euch bitte mit unseren
      Trauzeugen ab.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="info-block-left" , data-lang-text="en">
    <p class="header"><b>Join us</b></p>
    <p class="tight">
      Your presence is the greates gift! If you don't like to come empty handed,
      we are grateful for a contribution to our honeymoon fund.
    </p>
    <p class="tight">
      You would like to contribute to the evening program? Please get in touch
      with our witnesses.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="line"></div>
  <!-- RUECKMELDUNG BLOCK  -->
  <div class="info-block-center" , data-lang-text="de">
    <p class="header">Rückmeldung</p>
    Bitte meldet euch über das Formular bis zum 15.2.2026 bei uns. Für Allergien,
    besondere Wünsche und sonstige Anmerkungen nutzt bitte das freie Kommentarfeld.
    Wir freuen uns auf euch!
  </div>

  <div class="info-block-center" , data-lang-text="en">
    <p class="header">RSVP</p>
    Please you the form below to let us know if you can make it by February 15, 2026.
    For allergies and dietary preferences please use the comment box below. We are
    looking forward to celebrate with you!
  </div>

  <div data-lang-text="de">
    <Form language="de" />
  </div>

  <div data-lang-text="en">
    <Form language="en" />
  </div>
</Layout>
